  "question": {
    "text": "A road is banked at an angle of <math> <mrow> <msup> <mrow> <mn>30</mn></mrow> <mo>∘</mo> </msup> </mrow> </math> to the horizontal for negotiating a curve of radius <math> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mn>0</mn> <msqrt> <mn>3</mn> </msqrt> <mo>m</mo> </mrow> </math>.&nbsp;At what velocity will a car experience no friction while negotiating the curve? Take <math> <mrow> <mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup> <mrow> <mtext>ms</mtext></mrow> <mrow> <mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow> </msup> </mrow> </math>",
